how the student member of the Oregon Health and Science University board can take part in talks about student collective bargaining, sets a rule that the board must meet at least four times a year, lets education service district board members get stipends, and changes some state education duties and reports. It also lets some school districts and education service districts use new exceptions in a few cases, and it took effect on March 31, 2026 as an emergency law.","aiSummaryBasis":"official summary","aiSummaryModel":"gpt-5.4-mini","aiSummaryGenerated":"2026-11-05","aiSummaryThin":false},"OR-2026R1-HB4052":{"id":"OR-2026R1-HB4052","passed":true,"number":"HB 4052","title":"Relating to a tax credit for de novo banks; and prescribing an effective date.","summary":"Creates a corporate excise tax credit for each of the first three years that a bank does business in this state. Applies only to Oregon-chartered banks that commence business in tax years beginning on or after January 1, 2027, and before January 1, 2033. Takes effect on the 91st day following adjournment sine die.","summarySource":"Oregon legislature, summary (via Open States)","introduced":"2026-02-02","sponsor":{"name":"E. Werner Reschke","party":"R","state":"OR","district":"55"},"cosponsors":[{"name":"Anna Scharf","party":"R","state":"OR","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Christine Drazan","party":"R","state":"OR","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"David Brock Smith","party":"R","state":"OR","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Bobby Levy","party":"R","state":"OR","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Pam Marsh","party":"D","state":"OR","date":null,"withdrawn":false,"role":"Primary sponsor"},{"name":"Nathan Sosa","party":"D","state":"OR","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"David Gomberg","party":"D","state":"OR","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Ben Bowman","party":"D","state":"OR","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Zach Hudson","party":"D","state":"OR","date":null,"withdra